  "body": "While running RVSEC (runtime-verification tool) i found that `getSecretKey` currently reads an entry with `KeyStore.getEntry` and extracts its `SecretKeyEntry.secretKey`, so i changed the lookup to call `getKey(alias, null)` and cache the result only when it is a `SecretKey`. The existing cache-miss fallback still creates a key for absent or unusable values, so the cache and key-creation behavior remain intact. This project compiles.",
